@CarAutoParts.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### Login (default seed: admin / admin123)
POST {{CarAutoParts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Me
GET {{CarAutoParts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
